rough lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The fish have all gone down deep lately. Two all morning, that's all. It wasn't like this in my father's day.","zh":"这阵子鱼都沉到深水里去了，一上午就钓上来两条。我爹那时候可不是这样。"}},{"key":"weather:rain","text":{"en":"Fish come up in the rain, so I'll stay out a while longer. If you don't mind getting wet, you can watch.","zh":"下雨天鱼爱往上浮，我得多待一会儿。你不怕淋的话，就在边上看着吧。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Keep to the boards and stay out of the mud. And if you hear anything from the graveyard at night, don't go and look.","zh":"走路踩着木板走，别下到泥里。还有，夜里墓地那边要是有动静，别过去看。"}}]}}},{"type":"item/food/fish/raw","id":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1.s0.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1"}},{"type":"item/food/fish/raw","id":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1.s0.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1"}},{"type":"item/food/fish/raw","id":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1.s0.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1"}},{"type":"item/misc/bait","id":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1.s1.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1"}},{"type":"item/misc/bait","id":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1.s1.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1"}},{"type":"item/misc/bait","id":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1.s1.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1"}},{"id":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1"}},{"id":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1"}},{"id":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1"}},{"id":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1"}},{"id":"palefen.wanwick-camp.folk1.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on